### Welcome to SEDS J'pura

SEDS J'pura is the student space chapter at the University of Sri Jayewardenepura (USJ). Operating from the Faculty of Applied Sciences, Faculty of Technology, and Faculty of Engineering, our chapter unites curious minds with a shared passion for astronomy, space physics, aerospace engineering, and computational modeling.

### What We Do

SEDS J'pura offers undergraduates hands-on exposure and peer learning across key space disciplines:

- **Astrophysics & Space Physics Study Groups**: Exploring planetary dynamics, stellar astrophysics, gravitational wave astronomy, and orbital mechanics through student presentations and discussions.
- **Astrobiology & Space Life Sciences**: Investigating extremophiles, habitability conditions in the solar system, and bio-payload experimentation.
- **CanSat & Electronics Prototyping**: Building micro-telemetry payloads to measure atmospheric pressure, altitude, and temperature profiles during field tests.
- **Sky Camps & Public Astronomy Outreach**: Hosting telescope viewing sessions, Moon watching nights, and educational workshops for school students in the Western and Southern Provinces.

### Join SEDS J'pura

Membership is completely free and open to all registered undergraduate and postgraduate students of the University of Sri Jayewardenepura.

- **Campus Location**: University of Sri Jayewardenepura, Gangodawila, Nugegoda.
- **Email**: [sedsjpura@gmail.com](mailto:sedsjpura@gmail.com)
- **Get Involved**: Join our study circles, community workshops, and national space challenges.
